0..77 Comment "// A nested model: `oper inner : Model(Answering)` states that a model of the"
78..143 Comment "// theory holds a model of `Answering` under the name `inner`, as"
144..226 Comment "// `module-members.gandr`\'s record signature nests `inner : #{ answer: Integer }`."
227..304 Comment "// A model answers it with a nested module ascribed `Model(Answering)`, and a"
305..380 Comment "// reader reaches the nested model\'s members through the outer one. A model"
381..460 Comment "// sealed at the outer theory seals the nested one too, and its sort is written"
461..524 Comment "// as a path through the nested model\'s name, `Sealed.inner.T`."
525..527 Comment "//"
528..543 Comment "// - see: #1311"
